description	"Pirate Brute

^2Weaponry:
- Machete
-- ^1Red ^7/ ^6Purple ^7Styles
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)
- Cannon (1 Thermal Cannonball)
- Brute Force (Heavy Melee, Strong Against Melee)

^8Attributes:
- Knockdown Chance [Saber Knockdown]

The intimidator of the group. He keeps the other pirates in check. The machete is a large cleaver like tool, which is popular in the carribean islands. It was originally used to cut through the rain forest but can also be used as a deadly weapon."